  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disaster Risk Reduction Governance &amp; Build Environment in Jak Cluster Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO supports its member states in enhancing their knowledge of technical and policy aspects, particularly on 1) Early Warning Systems; 2) Science, Technology and Innovation such as Artificial Intelligence; 3) School safety; 4) UNESCO designated sites resilience; 5) Built Environment; 6) Nature-based Solutions, 7) Risk Governance; and 8) Post-disaster Response through a multi-hazards, multi-disciplines, and multi-stakeholders engagement approach. All activities will align with the Sendai Framework for Disaster Risk Reduction 2015-2030, SDGs 1, 4, 9, 11, 13 and 15 and Paris Agreement.</narrative>
  </description>
